message: "If you use these reference tables, please cite them as below."
title: "Face shape ratio profiles and landmark measurements"
abstract: >-
  The reference data behind a browser-only face shape detector: the seven target
  ratio profiles with their tolerances, the four landmark measurements and the
  landmark index list, plus a printable tape-measure worksheet. Every threshold
  is the site's own published heuristic value rather than a published standard.
